":literal\"><semantics><mrow><mi class=\"ltx_font_mathcaligraphic\">𝒰</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3.0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{U}(1.5,3.0)</annotation></semantics></math> m, and all sources and microphones are placed at a height of 1.0 m.\n461\t</figcaption>\n462\t</figure>\n463\t<figure id=\"S3.T1\" class=\"ltx_table\">\n464\t<figcaption class=\"ltx_caption ltx_centering\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_table\">Table 1: </span>\n465\tEvaluation of frontends across three base <abbr title=\"self-supervised learning\" class=\"ltx_glossaryref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_glossary_short\">SSL</span></abbr> models.\n466\tThe values are official scores, and Total shows the harmonic mean of the scores over the machine types.\n467\tThe mean, CI95, and ensemble results across the three trials are reported.\n468\tThe backend consists of BEAM and <abbr title=\"relative deviation pooling\" class=\"ltx_glossaryref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_glossary_short\">RDP</span></abbr> with <math id=\"S3.T1.3.m1\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"\\gamma=4\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma=4</annotation></semantics></math>.\n469\tNA denotes <abbr title=\"noise-aware   ()\" class=\"ltx_glossaryref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_glossary_short\">NA-SSL</span></abbr> pre-training, and Dis denotes discriminative fine-tuning.\n470\t<sup id=\"S3.T1.10.1\" class=\"ltx_sup\">∗</sup> denotes machine types without attribute labels.\n471\t</figcaption>\n472\t<div id=\"S3.T1.8\" class=\"ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer\" style=\"width:345.0pt;height:86.5pt;vertical-align:-42.0pt;\"><span class=\"ltx_transformed_inner\" style=\"transform:translate(-168.5pt,42.2pt) scale(0.505854690276226,0.505854690276226) ;\">\n473\t<table i