ic</text></g></g></g></g></g><g class=\"ltx_tikzmatrix_row\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 1 0 32.87)\"><g class=\"ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\"><g class=\"ltx_nestedsvg\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 1 0 0) translate(3,0) translate(0,3.89)\"><g style=\"--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#BFBFBF;\" fill=\"#BFBFBF\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.5pt\"><path d=\"M -2.66 -1.24 M -2.66 -1.24 L -2.66 1.24 L -0.71 1.24 L -0.71 -1.24 Z M -0.71 1.24\"></path></g><g style=\"--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#D2D2D2;\" fill=\"#D2D2D2\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.5pt\"><path d=\"M -0.71 -2.13 L 2.66 -3.54 L 2.66 3.54 L -0.71 2.13 Z\"></path></g></g><g></g><text transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">: noise sources</text></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></span>\n<figcaption class=\"ltx_caption ltx_centering\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure\">Figure 2: </span>\nRoom geometry for simulation.\nThe room height is sampled from <math id=\"S3.F2.2.m1\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"\\mathcal{U}(1.5,3.0)\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><mi class=\"ltx_font_mathcaligraphic\">𝒰</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3.0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{U}(1.5,3.0)</annotation></semantics></math> m, and all sources and microphones are placed at a height of 1.0 m.\n</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure id=\"S3.T1\" class=\"ltx_table\">\n<figcaption class=\"ltx_caption ltx_centering\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_table\">Table 1: </span>\nEvaluation of frontends across three base <abbr title=\"self-supervised learning\" class=\"ltx_glossaryref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_glossary_short\">SSL</span></abbr> models.\nThe values are official scores, and Total shows the harmonic mean of the scores over the machine types.\nThe mean, CI95, and ensemble results across the three trials are reported.\nThe backend consists of BEAM and <abbr title=\"relative deviation pooling\" class=\"ltx_glossaryref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_glossary_short\">RDP</span></abbr> with <math id=\"S3.T1.3.m1\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"\\gamma=4\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma=4</annotation></semantics></math>.\nNA denotes <abbr title=\"noise-aware   ()\" class=\"ltx_glossaryref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_glossary_short\">NA-SSL</span></abbr> pre-training, and Dis denotes discriminative fine-tuning.\n<sup id=\"S3.T1.10.1\" class=\"ltx_sup\">∗</sup> denotes machine types without attribute labels.\n</figcaption>\n<div id=\"S3.T1.8\" class=\"ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer\" style=\"width:345.0pt;height:86.5pt;vertical-align:-42.0pt;\"><span class=\"ltx_transformed_inner\" style=\"transform:translate(-168.5pt,42.2pt) scale(0.505854690276226,0.505854690276226) ;\">\n<table id=\"S3.T1.8.4\" class=\"ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle\">\n<tr id=\"S3.T1.8.4.5\" class=\"ltx_tr\">\n<td id=\"S3.T1.8.4.5.1\" class=\"ltx_td ltx_border_tt\"></td>\n<td id=\"S3.T1.8.4.5.2\" class=\"ltx_td ltx_border_tt\"></td>\n<td id=\"S3.T1.8.4.5.3\" class=\"ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt\" colspan=\"8\">Mean (CI95)</td>\n<td id=\"S3.T1.8.4.5.4\" class=\"ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt\">\n<span id=\"S3.T1.8.4.5.4.1\" class=\"ltx_text\"></span> <span id=\"S3.T1.8.4.5.4.2\" class=\"ltx_text\">\n<span id=\"S3.T1.8.4.5.4.2.1\" class=\"ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle\">\n<span id=\"S3.T1.8.4.5.4.2.1.1\" class=\"ltx_tr\">\n<span id=\"S3.T1.8.4.5.4.2.1.1.1\" class=\"ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center\">Ensemble</span></span>\n</span></span><span id=\"S3.T1.8.4.5.4.3\" class=\"ltx_text\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"S3.T1.8.4.4\" class=\"ltx_tr\">\n<td id=\"S3.T1.8.4.4.5\" class=\"ltx_td ltx_align_left\">Base</td>\n<td id=\"S3.T1.8.4.4.6\" 